@* Home.razor — Landing page for Remy's Recipes.
   Displays app branding, description, and navigation cards to Recipes and Shopping List. *@
@page "/"

<div class="landing">
    <h1>🐀 Remy's Recipes</h1>
    <p class="tagline">"Anyone can cook!" — Inspired by Ratatouille</p>

    <p class="description">
        Save your favorite recipes, search by category, and generate shopping lists
        from ingredients. Everything in one place, no account needed.
    </p>

    <div class="features">
        <div class="feature-card">
            <h3>📖 Recipes</h3>
            <p>Add, browse, and search your recipe collection. Filter by category to find exactly what you need.</p>
            <a href="recipes">View Recipes</a>
        </div>

        <div class="feature-card">
            <h3>🛒 Shopping List</h3>
            <p>Generate a shopping list from recipe ingredients and check items off as you shop.</p>
            <a href="shoppinglist">View Shopping List</a>
        </div>
    </div>
</div>
